should be up to the parents

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.582
to make a decision on what they want

00:04:03.582 --> 00:04:05.460
to happen to their child.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.220
What I do when I'm
functioning as a pediatrician,

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.550
as a family medicine doctor,

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:13.410
I have a detailed
discussion with my parents.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.630
When I say parents, I mean
my patients who are parents.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.980
There's not a lot of great benefits.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.070
We're seeing some decreases
in what we call Balanitis,

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:23.200
which is inflammation of
the glands of the penis.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.450
There's been some research
on showing decreased

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.210
transmission of HIV in
those who are circumcised.

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:31.040
It's not evidence that's mind blowing

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.510
or even life changing.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:33.740
There's certainly side effects

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:36.850
if the procedure goes
wrong, and it can go wrong.

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.300
Things can go wrong with these procedures.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.080
I've seen botched circumcisions.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.510
Just think about how bad that is.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.330
I don't think it's mutilation,

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.930
I've heard some people discuss that,

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.440
because there are some benefits,

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.420
