Two hours, that's your answer.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.440
Just found your videos and I'm obsessed.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.300
I don't think it's healthy.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.133
Guess what?

00:09:29.133 --> 00:09:30.610
On the contrary, it is healthy.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:33.090
You're watching a doctor
break up misinformation,

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.710
teach you real stuff about your health,

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.690
give you some guidance,
allow you to have fun,

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:39.140
get your neurotransmitters
going, win, win, win, win, win.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.310
But please don't spend 500 hours a day

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.330
watching my videos.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.260
See that was a trick statement.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.840
There's no 500 hours in a day.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.050
I was exaggerating.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:50.090
And you'll know that
because you're educated.

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.860
If radiation can cause cancer,

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.650
how come doctors use it to try
and shrink the cancer cell?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.030
Radiation is lethal to cells.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.090
Now cancer cells are cells too.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:02.180
So if we can target the
radiation very accurately,

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.370
and now we have amazing technology

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:08.230
courtesy of radiation
specialists, physics specialists.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:11.010
When you can target
radiation at the tumor cell,

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.980
you can actually kill those cancer cells.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:13.813
Phan howlter.

00:10:13.813 --> 00:10:17.343
Is it normal for me to be able
to touch my head to my butt.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.060
Okay, I'm not flexible so I can't do it.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.290
You could be hypermobile.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.570
I have patients with hypermobile joints.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:25.750
While that could be a sign
of a clinical condition

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.330
like Marfan's or some other ones,

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.280
what I know about people
who are hypermobile

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.870
is they're more susceptible to injuries.

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.610
You're supposed to have a
limited range of motion,

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.080
and when you go past that
physiologic range of motion

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.340
you could actually cause damage.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.210
Talk to your doctor about
what you can be doing

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.780
and where you have to exercise caution.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.540
What do you give first,
good news or bad news?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.130
Cameron, when I receive news,

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.720
I want to hear the bad news first.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.450
I'll take that shock, and then hopefully

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.920
the good news will make me feel better

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.610
and I'll forget all about the shock.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.350
When I'm delivering the news,

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.630
I think I like to do the same thing.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.140
Making people wait for bad news

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:59.780
can increase the anxiety
related to that bad news

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.900
therefore making the
person more susceptible

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.950
to negative effects.

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.440
That's my medical way
of thinking about it.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.990
I saw my first mental
health professional today.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.794
Can we talk about how weird it is to talk

00:11:09.794 --> 00:11:12.920
about inner feelings
with a total stranger?

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.340
Stephanie, you're 100% right.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.120
It's hard to talk to
to a complete stranger.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.300
It takes time to build the rapport,

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.700
and we're not gonna give you a diagnosis

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.810
and a treatment plan right
away from the first visit.

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.040
It takes time for you to
be able to share things,

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.130
create a connection.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.420
Make sure to stay positive,

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:30.730
carry a personal sense of responsibility,

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.820
and know that there is no
obstacle that is too big

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:34.653
for you to overcome.

00:11:34.653 --> 00:11:36.040
If you come with that mindset,

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.620
you will do better with your outcomes.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:40.840
I know many of you are
incredibly passionate

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.980
about mental health,

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:44.048
so click up here for
my mental health video,

00:11:44.048 --> 00:11:45.680
and tell me what you think.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.540
If you have a question,
leave it down below

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.140
in the comments 'cause
clearly I like answering them

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.163
As always, stay happy and healthy.

